1
00:01:43,079 --> 00:01:45,760
Let go of me! Don't touch me!

2
00:01:46,879 --> 00:01:48,400
Help!

3
00:01:51,079 --> 00:01:52,560
Zhuang Yan!

4
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,319
Save me!

5
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:57,840
After that incident,

6
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,480
I went looking for Xiaoyi several times.

7
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,719
She always refused to see me.

8
00:02:04,719 --> 00:02:06,000
Later, I learned

9
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:09,199
that the man who hurt Xiaoyi was a fugitive.

10
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,560
Even though he was brought to justice,

11
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,800
the gray zone lurking in my memory

12
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:17,719
and the guilt deep in my heart could never be erased.

13
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,039
Sometimes I wonder...

14
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:22,240
If I had been brave enough to step forward that day,

15
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,680
things wouldn't have ended like this.

16
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:26,759
But I didn't.

17
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,960
I was weak.

18
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,199
A coward.

19
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:36,280
Thank you for confiding your secret in me.

20
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:40,560
You were still very young back then.

21
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:41,680
Fear

22
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,719
is a completely natural human reaction.

23
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,439
You don't need to blame yourself so much,

24
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,680
nor should you carry this guilt

25
00:02:48,879 --> 00:02:50,759
into every single operation.

26
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:52,360
Because doing so

27
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,919
isn't punishing the criminal;

28
00:02:55,039 --> 00:02:56,319
is punishing

29
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:58,400
yourself in your memories.

30
00:03:01,039 --> 00:03:01,800
Of course,

31
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,000
no one is asking you

32
00:03:04,039 --> 00:03:06,159
to completely forget that past.

33
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:10,599
I believe if you faced the same situation again,

34
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,680
with your abilities today

35
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:16,719
and your judgment, you'd make the right choice.

36
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,639
But if you can't let it go,

37
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:23,439
the harm will still remain.

38
00:03:25,759 --> 00:03:28,360
And precisely because of how capable you are,

39
00:03:28,879 --> 00:03:30,759
that harm could compound even further.

40
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,000
That brings harm to yourself,

41
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:34,879
to the case,

42
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,840
and even to your comrades.

43
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,759
Fighting violence with violence

44
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,240
is not what justice is truly about.

45
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:53,120
A true police officer

46
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,960
brings criminals to justice,

47
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:58,360
rather than taking the law into their own hands

48
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,240
to punish them.

49
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:01,439
Zhuang Yan,

50
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:04,159
I believe someone as capable as you

51
00:04:04,719 --> 00:04:06,360
will, in future operations,

52
00:04:07,599 --> 00:04:08,879
know where to draw the line

53
00:04:09,319 --> 00:04:11,360
and overcome this psychological hurdle.

54
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,520
I will.

55
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,639
Captain...

56
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,360
did you just say,

57
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,160
"in future operations"?

58
00:04:27,839 --> 00:04:28,439
Here's your order:

59
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,680
Find Wu Liang's whereabouts as soon as possible,

60
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,040
and bring him in.

61
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:34,839
Yes, sir!

62
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,480
Who is it?

63
00:04:50,959 --> 00:04:52,040
Coming, coming!

64
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:59,439
What took you so long?

65
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,079
Brother Hao, what brings you here?

66
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:06,519
Cut the crap.

67
00:05:08,399 --> 00:05:09,959
I brought you some good stuff.

68
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,040
I haven't had a fix in ages.

69
00:05:14,319 --> 00:05:15,120
Make yourself at home.

70
00:05:15,279 --> 00:05:16,279
I'm gonna go get my hit.

71
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,639
Here are the files just pulled from the registry.

72
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,240
The suspect's name is Geng Hao.

73
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:29,839
He's from Xihe City, Shanxi.

74
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:32,480
Worked security at Cotton Mill No. 1.

75
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:34,480
But he resigned three years ago.

76
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:36,319
His file has stayed at the mill ever since.

77
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,319
Which means,

78
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,720
over these past three years,

79
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,560
his record has been a total blank.

80
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,800
Nice sketch.

81
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:44,800
How about it?

82
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:45,800
Up for a contest?

83
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:51,000
Deal. Wu Liang is mine.

84
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:52,160
Geng Hao is mine.

85
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:04,199
Brother Hao, do you have much stuff left?

86
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:05,399
I could take it to the club

87
00:06:05,639 --> 00:06:06,800
and sell it to those rich folks.

88
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,120
Has using fried your brain?

89
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,920
I never deal drugs.

90
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,439
I use, I don't sell.

91
00:06:14,839 --> 00:06:15,600
Right, use, don't sell.

92
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,439
Next time you get good stuff like this,

93
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:19,120
don't forget your buddy.

94
00:06:20,959 --> 00:06:22,040
I'm heading out this afternoon.

95
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,560
Let me borrow your car.

96
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,279
No problem.

97
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:29,240
Brother Hao,

98
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:30,639
take it anytime.

99
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,879
Here is a wanted notice.

100
00:06:55,399 --> 00:06:56,759
The suspect, Geng Hao,

101
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:58,079
is 180 centimeters tall,

102
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:59,759
weighs about 75 kilograms,

103
00:07:00,279 --> 00:07:01,639
and is a native of Xihe, Shanxi.

104
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:04,360
He previously worked in security at No. 1 Cotton Mill.

105
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,879
Anyone with information on his whereabouts

106
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,279
should immediately call the number on screen

107
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,120
or dial 110 to report it.

108
00:07:14,199 --> 00:07:15,000
Brother Hao,

109
00:07:15,639 --> 00:07:17,040
don't worry, just stay here.

110
00:07:17,439 --> 00:07:18,920
I won't tell anyone.

111
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:19,920
It's fine.

112
00:07:21,199 --> 00:07:22,040
Eat up.

113
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,079
Hello.

114
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:22,639
Hi, does Mingzai work here?

115
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:23,720
Looking for Brother Ming?

116
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,680
I'll take you over.

117
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:28,240
This way, please.

118
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,000
Brother Ming, someone's here to see you.

119
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:50,559
Get up.

120
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:56,120
Have you seen the person in this photo?

121
00:08:56,559 --> 00:08:57,559
He's been here a few times.

122
00:08:57,919 --> 00:08:59,279
Lili served him every time.

123
00:09:00,279 --> 00:09:01,639
Where is this Lili now?

124
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,600
Haven't seen her in a while.

125
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:09,720
But around here,

126
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,159
a customer service manager named Xiao Bai

127
00:09:11,639 --> 00:09:12,600
knows him really well.

128
00:09:14,039 --> 00:09:15,240
This Xiao Bai,

129
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,799
please call him over for me.

130
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,120
He hasn't come to work all day.

131
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,799
He's supposed to be here by two in the afternoon,

132
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,519
but he still hasn't shown up.

133
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:23,600
I tried calling him,

134
00:09:23,919 --> 00:09:24,879
but his phone was turned off.

135
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,159
Start talking.

136
00:09:32,159 --> 00:09:32,879
A few days ago,

137
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,039
Brother Liang called and asked me

138
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,120
if I wanted to do some egg tart business.

139
00:09:36,159 --> 00:09:37,639
I knew there was a shortage out there,

140
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,080
and I wanted to make extra cash,

141
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,519
so I agreed.

142
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:42,320
Time and place of the deal.

143
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,159
I suggest you think this through.

144
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,320
What you've done

145
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:55,639
is enough to put you away for eight to ten years.

146
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:00,440
If you actively assist the police investigation,

147
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,480
your sentence might be reduced.

148
00:10:03,279 --> 00:10:04,159
Have you thought it through?

149
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:06,840
Tomorrow morning at ten.

150
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:08,960
Roma Square.

151
00:10:44,279 --> 00:10:45,000
Captain Bai.

152
00:10:47,679 --> 00:10:49,399
Based on witness statements,

153
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,159
a guy nicknamed Xiao Bai

154
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:53,120
was in close contact with Geng Hao recently.

155
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,519
We followed the leads here,

156
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:56,519
but unfortunately,

157
00:10:57,039 --> 00:10:58,200
we were still too late.

158
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:02,360
Looks like the killer has been staying here lately.

159
00:11:03,679 --> 00:11:05,200
But he probably won't be coming back.

160
00:11:06,559 --> 00:11:07,159
Also,

161
00:11:07,519 --> 00:11:09,039
the victim has a car registered in his name,

162
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:11,759
but the car keys and phone are missing.

163
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:13,399
The killer must have taken them.

164
00:12:06,559 --> 00:12:08,960
The time is 9:57.

165
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:11,639
Suspect Wu Liang could appear at any moment.

166
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,080
All units, stay alert.

167
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,879
Maintain tight surveillance.

168
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:16,799
Copy that.

169
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:14,879
Okay, got it.

170
00:13:18,919 --> 00:13:19,480
Boss.

171
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,080
Haozi found Wu Liang.

172
00:13:21,159 --> 00:13:23,159
The cops are watching Wu Liang, though.

173
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:27,000
Isn't that too risky?

174
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:33,000
Keeping Wu Liang alive is the biggest risk.

175
00:13:34,919 --> 00:13:37,879
Tell Geng Hao to make it clean.

176
00:13:39,679 --> 00:13:40,159
Will do.

177
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:54,159
Copy that.

178
00:13:55,279 --> 00:13:57,399
Captain Bai, word from the info center.

179
00:13:57,519 --> 00:13:59,480
The Yujingwan Apartments victim's phone just turned on.

180
00:13:59,759 --> 00:14:01,120
The signal is around the plaza.

181
00:14:05,559 --> 00:14:07,639
Attention all units. Attention all units.

182
00:14:07,799 --> 00:14:09,879
Suspect Geng Hao, Geng Hao...

183
00:14:09,919 --> 00:14:11,399
is very likely at the scene.

184
00:14:11,559 --> 00:14:13,720
Arrest him immediately on sight.

185
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,960
Arrest him immediately.

186
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,519
Geng Hao and Wu Liang spotted

187
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,519
by the fountain.

188
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,399
Move in!

189
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,399
There's a kid! Hold your fire!

190
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,159
Get out of the way!

191
00:15:16,879 --> 00:15:17,600
I'll handle this.

192
00:15:30,159 --> 00:15:30,679
Freeze!

193
00:15:30,919 --> 00:15:31,440
Stop!

194
00:15:31,759 --> 00:15:32,279
Stop right there!

195
00:16:00,639 --> 00:16:01,159
Drop your gun.

196
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,279
Put the gun down.

197
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,559
Nobody move!

198
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:09,240
How much do you cops make a month anyway?

199
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,480
Why risk your lives?

200
00:16:11,399 --> 00:16:14,000
Know why I killed that woman?

201
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:16,360
Because she thrilled me so much.

202
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:18,039
I beat her relentlessly.

203
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:20,639
The way she begged me for mercy...

204
00:16:20,639 --> 00:16:22,240
I thought it was beautiful.

205
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:24,799
The more terrified she was, the more excited I got.

206
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:26,840
I pushed her off the 15th floor.

207
00:16:26,919 --> 00:16:28,480
Hearing her scream...

208
00:16:28,559 --> 00:16:30,600
Watching her plunge all the way down...

209
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:32,440
What a rush.

210
00:16:33,039 --> 00:16:35,840
I'd never felt anything like it.

211
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:37,360
Want to try it yourself?

212
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:40,559
It's way more thrilling than busting drug dealers.

213
00:16:41,039 --> 00:16:42,080
Come and get me!

214
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:42,919
Come on!

215
00:16:43,159 --> 00:16:43,919
Catch me if you can!

216
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:03,799
Let go of me! Let me go!

217
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:06,880
Zhuang Yan!

218
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:08,119
Zhuang Yan!

219
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:10,480
Help!

220
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,759
Zhuang Yan, let go!

221
00:17:22,359 --> 00:17:23,039
Zhuang Yan!

222
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:25,319
Zhuang Yan! Nobody move!

223
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,160
Help me!

224
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,920
Zhuang Yan!

225
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:56,519
Zhuang Yan,

226
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:00,599
let it go.

227
00:18:33,519 --> 00:18:34,119
Don't run!

228
00:19:40,359 --> 00:19:40,920
Don't move!

229
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:45,279
Freeze! Police!

230
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:51,160
After nearly three months of joint investigation,

231
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:54,240
we cracked the Xiangdu Club drug case,

232
00:19:54,519 --> 00:19:58,079
the Ring Expressway arson, and the Qinyi Garden murder,

233
00:19:58,119 --> 00:19:59,400
arresting the prime suspect, Wu Liang,

234
00:19:59,559 --> 00:20:02,079
and 17 drug suspects tied to him,

235
00:20:02,079 --> 00:20:04,799
dealing a heavy blow to cocaine and Psychedelic Blues

236
00:20:04,799 --> 00:20:06,519
distribution networks in our city.

237
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:09,079
Thus far, Operation Thunderbolt has achieved

238
00:20:09,079 --> 00:20:11,240
a major phased success.

239
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:14,000
Our operation

240
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:16,200
received great attention from the Municipal Committee.

241
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:18,279
The committee leaders asked me to convey

242
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:20,680
to every comrade who took part

243
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,359
their highest respect.

244
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:24,240
With your tenacious will,

245
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,960
you curbed the spread of narcotics

246
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:28,240
and safeguarded our city's stability and prosperity.

247
00:20:28,359 --> 00:20:30,400
Here, I would also like to

248
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:32,279
express my personal respect.

249
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:34,880
Salute!

250
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,279
Wu Liang and Qin Hao

251
00:20:44,279 --> 00:20:46,359
both gave up their supplier,

252
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:48,000
a man nicknamed "Boss Ma."

253
00:20:48,759 --> 00:20:49,880
According to our verification,

254
00:20:50,279 --> 00:20:52,640
his real name is Ma Jingrong,

255
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:56,240
and he has deep ties to Longze Group.

256
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:59,720
All signs indicate

257
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:01,039
that behind them

258
00:21:01,279 --> 00:21:02,799
lies a tightly organized,

259
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:04,839
highly cautious criminal syndicate.

260
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:07,480
It seems Operation Thunderbolt

261
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:09,920
still faces a tremendous challenge.

262
00:21:10,759 --> 00:21:12,960
Our adversaries are not only cunning,

263
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:16,359
they're also backed by powerful protective umbrellas.

264
00:21:20,759 --> 00:21:22,640
Since linking these three cases,

265
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:24,000
there have always been people

266
00:21:24,079 --> 00:21:25,960
reaching out through various channels,

267
00:21:26,119 --> 00:21:27,599
reminding me of Longze Group's

268
00:21:27,599 --> 00:21:30,000
vital role in our city's business community,

269
00:21:30,559 --> 00:21:33,000
baselessly trying to clear

270
00:21:33,119 --> 00:21:35,319
Longze Group's ties to the drug trade.

271
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:38,920
Of course, without sufficient evidence,

272
00:21:39,359 --> 00:21:40,200
we can't assert

273
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:42,839
that our suspicions of Longze Group are accurate.

274
00:21:44,559 --> 00:21:45,799
Our investigation should,

275
00:21:46,359 --> 00:21:49,160
as much as possible, avoid disrupting the city's stability and development.

276
00:21:49,319 --> 00:21:50,160
Chief...

277
00:21:52,079 --> 00:21:53,279
Don't tell me you're...

278
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:54,680
Sit down.

279
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:00,720
Keep a low profile.

280
00:22:01,039 --> 00:22:02,279
Infiltrate gradually.

281
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:04,000
We can't rush this.

282
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:06,640
When the enemy is hidden and we're exposed,

283
00:22:07,279 --> 00:22:08,799
give them room to breathe.

284
00:22:09,119 --> 00:22:11,039
Once they let their guard down,

285
00:22:11,119 --> 00:22:13,119
we'll round them all up in one fell swoop.

286
00:22:16,279 --> 00:22:17,920
That's my chief, as sharp as ever.

287
00:22:18,039 --> 00:22:18,799
Cut the flattery.

288
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:27,359
You've been watching for ages.

289
00:22:27,759 --> 00:22:28,480
Well? How is it?

290
00:22:28,599 --> 00:22:30,119
Let me observe a bit longer.

291
00:22:30,119 --> 00:22:32,960
Come on, you're a cop, aren't you?

292
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:34,960
You're not afraid of drug lords, yet this terrifies you?

293
00:22:35,039 --> 00:22:35,920
What do you know?

294
00:22:37,119 --> 00:22:38,400
With drug dealers, at least you know

295
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:39,960
what they want deep down.

296
00:22:40,039 --> 00:22:41,480
But when it comes to women,

297
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:43,960
you never have a clue.

298
00:22:46,720 --> 00:22:47,319
Fair point.

299
00:22:48,519 --> 00:22:49,359
Cut the chatter.

300
00:22:49,359 --> 00:22:49,920
I'm telling you,

301
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:50,640
are you going over or not?

302
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:52,519
If not, I'm out of here.

303
00:22:55,279 --> 00:22:56,200
Stay with me a little longer.

304
00:22:59,240 --> 00:22:59,960
Fine, I'll go.

305
00:23:02,759 --> 00:23:03,519
I'm going.

306
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:13,000
Here's your coffee.

307
00:23:14,519 --> 00:23:15,160
Thank you.

308
00:23:15,359 --> 00:23:15,920
Enjoy.

309
00:23:27,599 --> 00:23:28,960
Give me some time, okay?

310
00:23:44,039 --> 00:23:45,039
I just want to know

311
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:47,079
why you mind so much that I'm a cop.

312
00:23:51,079 --> 00:23:52,119
It's not that I mind.

313
00:23:53,799 --> 00:23:54,880
I'm worried.

314
00:23:56,880 --> 00:23:59,240
Do you know why, after finding out you're a cop,

315
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:02,319
I deliberately kept my distance from you?

316
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:23,319
This is an old comrade of mine.

317
00:24:24,440 --> 00:24:25,680
Nineteen years ago,

318
00:24:26,559 --> 00:24:28,400
we were sent to Shangnao River together

319
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,599
on a secret mission.

320
00:24:29,839 --> 00:24:31,119
During the operation,

321
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:32,960
to cover me,

322
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:34,880
he sacrificed his own life.

323
00:24:45,039 --> 00:24:46,319
It's been 19 years.

324
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:48,359
My old comrade...

325
00:24:48,759 --> 00:24:50,920
I've always felt so guilty toward your family.

326
00:24:56,759 --> 00:24:57,720
This photo is...

327
00:24:59,319 --> 00:25:00,440
He's my father.

328
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:04,039
He was a cop too.

329
00:25:07,519 --> 00:25:08,920
I've heard about your father's deeds.

330
00:25:09,920 --> 00:25:10,519
Years ago,

331
00:25:11,519 --> 00:25:14,000
our chief took me to visit your father's grave.

332
00:25:15,759 --> 00:25:16,599
Uncle Huang.

333
00:25:17,880 --> 00:25:19,079
Looks like you know each other too.

334
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,799
Over the past 19 years,

335
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:33,000
I've rarely gone to see him.

336
00:25:34,480 --> 00:25:36,519
I know everything he did was right.

337
00:25:39,119 --> 00:25:41,000
But I just couldn't forgive him.

338
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:47,680
If he'd listened to my mom back then,

339
00:25:51,240 --> 00:25:52,519
and given up being a cop,

340
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:56,480
then at least in my childhood,

341
00:25:56,839 --> 00:25:58,680
I could've been like other kids,

342
00:26:00,880 --> 00:26:02,319
with a father by my side.

343
00:26:08,920 --> 00:26:10,519
Now I understand why you mind so much

344
00:26:11,640 --> 00:26:13,240
that I'm a cop.

345
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:30,759
If I'd known you were a cop from the start,

346
00:26:34,359 --> 00:26:36,000
things never would've started between us.

347
00:26:43,599 --> 00:26:45,480
But what am I supposed to do now?

348
00:26:54,119 --> 00:26:56,440
I can't convince myself to stop loving you,

349
00:26:59,240 --> 00:27:02,480
and I certainly can't convince you to stop being a cop.

350
00:27:16,759 --> 00:27:18,079
Can you promise me

351
00:27:19,119 --> 00:27:20,599
no matter where you are in the future,

352
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:24,480
whenever I need you,

353
00:27:25,799 --> 00:27:27,400
you'll be by my side?

354
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:30,440
Can you do that?

355
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:44,640
I promise you.

356
00:28:08,759 --> 00:28:09,799
Mom was in a meeting earlier.

357
00:28:09,920 --> 00:28:10,880
It just ended.

358
00:28:11,200 --> 00:28:12,160
I'm running a bit late.

359
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:13,720
Wait there for Mom for a bit, okay?

360
00:28:14,839 --> 00:28:16,200
Alright, see you in a bit!

361
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:31,319
Hello?

362
00:28:32,279 --> 00:28:32,799
Captain Bai.

363
00:28:34,759 --> 00:28:36,000
It's an honor.

364
00:28:37,759 --> 00:28:38,440
Who is this?

365
00:28:38,839 --> 00:28:39,759
We haven't met,

366
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:43,480
but I know you've been looking for me.

367
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:47,480
Ah, Mr. Ma.

368
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:49,000
My apologies.

369
00:28:49,359 --> 00:28:51,160
To make you go through the trouble of calling me yourself.

370
00:28:53,359 --> 00:28:53,759
Tao!

371
00:28:54,279 --> 00:28:55,680
Trace Captain Bai's phone right now!

372
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:04,519
Captain Bai, you're quite the heroine.

373
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:06,000
Truly impressive.

374
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:08,119
I had to call you myself

375
00:29:08,480 --> 00:29:10,200
to pay my respects.

376
00:29:11,079 --> 00:29:12,160
You flatter me, Mr. Ma.

377
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:15,640
You run quite a massive enterprise yourself.

378
00:29:15,759 --> 00:29:17,839
Though I hear you've taken some losses lately.

379
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:19,640
Found a way to fix that yet?

380
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:25,759
Everything comes at a cost. There's always a price.

381
00:29:26,039 --> 00:29:27,319
He's on a satellite phone.

382
00:29:27,599 --> 00:29:28,799
It has a built-in anti-tracking chip.

383
00:29:28,839 --> 00:29:29,960
We can't trace the location.

384
00:29:32,160 --> 00:29:33,240
Patch the audio through!

385
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:34,039
Captain Bai...

386
00:29:34,519 --> 00:29:37,400
I wonder if you'd do me a favor.

387
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,680
You're too polite.

388
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,039
What do you want me to do?

389
00:29:40,119 --> 00:29:41,079
As long as it's within my power,

390
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:42,160
I'll do my best.

391
00:29:42,680 --> 00:29:43,759
Two months ago,

392
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:47,319
one of my boys was blind enough

393
00:29:47,839 --> 00:29:49,400
to walk right into your crosshairs.

394
00:29:49,839 --> 00:29:50,440
He's dead.

395
00:29:50,599 --> 00:29:52,480
Never mind. I don't blame you for that.

396
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:55,039
It's his own fault for not watching his step.

397
00:29:55,480 --> 00:29:58,319
Still, I know lately, Captain Bai,

398
00:29:58,359 --> 00:30:00,240
you've been harassing my other boys.

399
00:30:00,279 --> 00:30:01,279
Of course, I know

400
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:04,039
your real target is me.

401
00:30:04,599 --> 00:30:05,759
Glad you realize that.

402
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,680
So what do you want me to do?

403
00:30:08,960 --> 00:30:09,839
Give me three months.

404
00:30:10,279 --> 00:30:11,880
Back off from my boys.

405
00:30:12,359 --> 00:30:14,960
When the time comes, I'll send you a generous gift.

406
00:30:15,200 --> 00:30:18,599
Mr. Ma, three months is too long.

407
00:30:18,920 --> 00:30:20,279
I can't justify that to my superiors.

408
00:30:20,440 --> 00:30:21,599
How about this?

409
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:23,519
I'll give you one night.

410
00:30:23,759 --> 00:30:24,720
Tomorrow morning,

411
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:27,640
have your boys turn themselves in to Narcotics.

412
00:30:28,119 --> 00:30:29,680
And I won't give them any trouble.

413
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:33,559
Since you're unwilling, Captain Bai,

414
00:30:34,880 --> 00:30:35,559
I won't force you.

415
00:30:36,039 --> 00:30:36,680
I understand.

416
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:39,319
After all, Captain Bai is the guardian angel

417
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:41,440
to millions of citizens in Nanhai City.

418
00:30:42,559 --> 00:30:45,599
Still, I wonder if a guardian like you

419
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:46,880
actually has what it takes

420
00:30:47,000 --> 00:30:48,480
to protect her own family?

421
00:30:56,119 --> 00:30:57,599
Contact the Jiangbei District patrol immediately!

422
00:30:57,799 --> 00:30:58,920
Have them rush to Jiangbei Primary School!

423
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:00,200
Captain Bai's daughter might be in danger!

424
00:31:36,839 --> 00:31:37,400
Huanhuan.

425
00:31:38,759 --> 00:31:39,519
Hello.

426
00:31:39,960 --> 00:31:42,000
I'm a colleague of Captain Bai Hua from Narcotics.

427
00:31:42,200 --> 00:31:43,440
Our captain has an urgent mission,

428
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:45,279
and asked me to pick Huanhuan up.

429
00:31:46,559 --> 00:31:47,319
Oh, I see.

430
00:31:48,759 --> 00:31:50,640
May I see your ID, please?

431
00:31:51,240 --> 00:31:52,279
Sure, no problem.

432
00:31:55,160 --> 00:31:55,920
Huanhuan!

433
00:31:56,039 --> 00:31:57,279
Help!

434
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:02,160
Help!

435
00:32:02,839 --> 00:32:03,640
Help me!

436
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:04,359
Don't move!

437
00:32:05,240 --> 00:32:05,759
Don't move!

438
00:32:28,039 --> 00:32:28,599
Huanhuan!

439
00:32:32,519 --> 00:32:33,000
Huanhuan!

440
00:32:33,319 --> 00:32:34,440
Mommy!

441
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:38,839
Mommy!

442
00:32:41,599 --> 00:32:42,440
I'm sorry.

443
00:32:44,279 --> 00:32:46,440
I'm sorry, Mommy got here late.

444
00:32:48,279 --> 00:32:49,359
Mommy was late.

445
00:32:56,880 --> 00:32:57,240
Boss,

446
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:59,240
why didn't we just take her out?

447
00:33:03,440 --> 00:33:05,400
Have you lost your mind?

448
00:33:05,920 --> 00:33:07,400
She's just a little girl.

449
00:33:10,640 --> 00:33:11,519
Doing this,

450
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:15,319
I just wanted to give her mother a warning.

451
00:33:15,559 --> 00:33:16,759
Besides, who knows?

452
00:33:16,839 --> 00:33:17,920
We might become friends in the future.

453
00:33:18,400 --> 00:33:18,920
Right?

454
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:20,759
Remember this.

455
00:33:21,559 --> 00:33:22,519
We're in business.

456
00:33:23,079 --> 00:33:25,559
Our top priority is to make money,

457
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:28,880
not to make enemies with cops.

458
00:33:31,839 --> 00:33:32,559
A-Qiang,

459
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:34,920
take a trip back to Nanhai

460
00:33:36,160 --> 00:33:39,039
and clean up the loose ends ASAP.

461
00:33:39,559 --> 00:33:41,480
Use your head more.

462
00:33:42,359 --> 00:33:43,640
Thank goodness you guys arrived in time.

463
00:33:43,960 --> 00:33:44,680
Otherwise, if Huanhuan had fallen into

464
00:33:44,759 --> 00:33:45,640
those two guys' hands,

465
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:46,920
the consequences would've been unthinkable.

466
00:33:47,880 --> 00:33:48,440
By the way,

467
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:49,799
how come you're here?

468
00:33:50,119 --> 00:33:52,039
I was recently transferred to the Jiangbei CID squadron.

469
00:33:54,839 --> 00:33:55,599
Demoted?

470
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:56,640
Did you mess up?

471
00:33:57,440 --> 00:33:58,839
It's an assignment to get grassroots experience.

472
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:01,240
Otherwise, how can I be a narcotics cop later?

473
00:34:02,640 --> 00:34:03,400
Really?

474
00:34:03,799 --> 00:34:04,839
Of course it is.

475
00:34:06,519 --> 00:34:08,079
Weren't you on leave, though?

476
00:34:08,519 --> 00:34:09,760
How did you manage to get here right away?

477
00:34:11,480 --> 00:34:12,519
In our line of work,

478
00:34:12,880 --> 00:34:14,039
there's no such thing as a vacation.

479
00:34:15,440 --> 00:34:16,639
When Captain Lu gave the order,

480
00:34:17,199 --> 00:34:18,400
we happened to be near the school.

481
00:34:27,199 --> 00:34:28,000
Take your time eating.

482
00:34:29,719 --> 00:34:30,559
Is it good?

483
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,239
Is our daughter okay?

484
00:34:38,760 --> 00:34:39,719
They caught them.

485
00:34:40,280 --> 00:34:40,880
She's fine now.

486
00:34:41,960 --> 00:34:43,360
Didn't we agree you'd pick her up today?

487
00:34:43,559 --> 00:34:44,760
Couldn't you have gone a bit earlier?

488
00:34:45,480 --> 00:34:46,800
If you had arrived one step too late,

489
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:49,039
would we ever see our daughter again?

490
00:34:52,960 --> 00:34:53,360
Captain Bai.

491
00:34:58,400 --> 00:34:59,000
How is it?

492
00:35:00,480 --> 00:35:02,440
Just two hired street thugs.

493
00:35:02,559 --> 00:35:03,440
Hired?

494
00:35:04,880 --> 00:35:06,360
Did you track down who's behind it?

495
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:08,039
Not yet.

496
00:35:08,079 --> 00:35:09,760
They dealt exclusively online.

497
00:35:10,519 --> 00:35:12,719
I suspect the mastermind

498
00:35:13,079 --> 00:35:14,280
just wanted to send us a warning,

499
00:35:14,639 --> 00:35:15,760
not actually commit violence.

500
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:17,519
The CID has already dispatched officers

501
00:35:17,559 --> 00:35:19,159
to stake out your home twenty-four/seven

502
00:35:19,599 --> 00:35:20,639
to keep your family safe.

503
00:35:20,920 --> 00:35:21,599
No need.

504
00:35:24,679 --> 00:35:25,440
Stake out for what?

505
00:35:25,639 --> 00:35:27,199
Can't even protect your own family,

506
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:28,440
and you're talking about twenty-four hours?

507
00:35:33,199 --> 00:35:33,760
Let's go.

508
00:35:34,639 --> 00:35:35,440
Come home with Daddy.

509
00:35:36,639 --> 00:35:39,960
No! No, I want to stay with Mommy!

510
00:35:40,519 --> 00:35:41,960
Your mom doesn't have time for us.

511
00:35:43,239 --> 00:35:43,960
She's Captain Bai.

512
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:48,880
Let's go.

513
00:35:51,639 --> 00:35:52,159
He Yong.

514
00:35:54,559 --> 00:35:55,159
I'm sorry.

515
00:35:58,400 --> 00:35:59,559
Say goodbye to Mommy.

516
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:03,159
Mommy...

517
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:24,199
He's just worried about you, too.

518
00:36:29,559 --> 00:36:30,719
The nerve of them!

519
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:32,480
These criminals

520
00:36:32,519 --> 00:36:33,760
have gotten so brazen.

521
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:36,719
It seems our crackdown on these criminals

522
00:36:36,800 --> 00:36:38,320
hasn't been nearly tough enough.

523
00:36:38,800 --> 00:36:40,159
They're actually delusional enough

524
00:36:40,519 --> 00:36:42,679
to take us on head-to-head.

525
00:36:43,320 --> 00:36:44,960
Fine. Starting today,

526
00:36:45,480 --> 00:36:47,000
we launch a full-scale anti-drug sweep.

527
00:36:47,239 --> 00:36:49,679
Raid every entertainment venue in Nanhai.

528
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:50,960
Anyone involved in drugs,

529
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:52,239
arrest every last one of them.

530
00:36:52,440 --> 00:36:53,039
Yes, sir!

531
00:37:33,039 --> 00:37:33,559
Chen Hai,

532
00:37:33,800 --> 00:37:35,440
CFO of Longze Group,

533
00:37:35,639 --> 00:37:37,760
once had close contact with Wu Liang.

534
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:39,840
According to Qin Hao's confession,

535
00:37:40,079 --> 00:37:42,360
for the stash he got from Ma Jingrong,

536
00:37:42,599 --> 00:37:45,599
the money had to go to an account specified by Chen Hai.

537
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:47,199
So we have reason to believe

538
00:37:47,519 --> 00:37:48,480
that Longze Group,

539
00:37:48,719 --> 00:37:50,480
even if not the mastermind of the drug deals,

540
00:37:50,719 --> 00:37:53,639
is definitely an accomplice laundering money for the cartel.

541
00:37:57,440 --> 00:37:58,800
Hu Dong, alias Scar,

542
00:37:59,039 --> 00:38:00,639
head of security at Longze Group,

543
00:38:01,159 --> 00:38:01,920
once worked with Wu Liang

544
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:04,400
and Wang Xiao, the ring road arson victim;

545
00:38:04,599 --> 00:38:05,800
they were all colleagues before.

546
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,840
According to Wu Liang's statement,

547
00:38:08,039 --> 00:38:09,239
it was through Hu Dong

548
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:11,400
that he met Li Qiang, Ma Jingrong's subordinate.

549
00:38:13,639 --> 00:38:15,239
Li Qiang has combat experience

550
00:38:15,440 --> 00:38:17,880
and was an accomplice of Geng Hao, the hospital attacker.

551
00:38:18,119 --> 00:38:20,000
His whereabouts are currently unknown.

552
00:38:22,519 --> 00:38:25,719
These three had direct contact with Ma Jingrong,

553
00:38:26,320 --> 00:38:27,360
and they are

554
00:38:27,800 --> 00:38:29,360
our breakthrough for the next step.

555
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:34,119
It seems Ma Jingrong is hiding in the shadows,

556
00:38:34,679 --> 00:38:36,599
yet skillfully leveraging a complex network

557
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:37,519
to do his bidding.

558
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:44,880
Excuse me... Operations Team?

559
00:38:48,639 --> 00:38:49,599
Okay, got it.

560
00:38:49,800 --> 00:38:50,679
Keep following up.

561
00:38:53,920 --> 00:38:54,679
Latest update.

562
00:38:55,280 --> 00:38:56,800
Three months ago,

563
00:38:56,880 --> 00:38:58,000
Ma Jingrong already left Nanhai.

564
00:38:58,119 --> 00:38:59,199
Three months ago?

565
00:38:59,320 --> 00:38:59,639
Yes.

566
00:39:00,320 --> 00:39:02,480
Wasn't that around the time Xiangdu Club was shut down?

567
00:39:09,559 --> 00:39:10,719
If Ma Jingrong

568
00:39:10,760 --> 00:39:12,480
already left Nanhai City,

569
00:39:14,119 --> 00:39:15,119
then why

570
00:39:15,920 --> 00:39:18,480
did he kidnap Captain Bai's daughter?

571
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:22,000
Ma Jingrong

572
00:39:22,639 --> 00:39:25,320
must still want to remotely control the drug deals here.

573
00:39:25,880 --> 00:39:28,280
He threatened Bai Hua to back off the investigation,

574
00:39:28,519 --> 00:39:30,880
likely wanting to dump the drugs he has

575
00:39:31,199 --> 00:39:31,840
as quickly as possible

576
00:39:32,039 --> 00:39:33,199
and leave Nanhai for good.

577
00:39:34,400 --> 00:39:36,239
We cannot let up on our anti-narcotics operation.

578
00:39:36,639 --> 00:39:37,679
We must quickly

579
00:39:37,840 --> 00:39:39,920
find any leads related to Ma Jingrong.

580
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:41,559
Yes, sir!

581
00:40:00,679 --> 00:40:01,599
Buddha bless us.

582
00:40:02,639 --> 00:40:03,880
Keep Brother Rong safe.

583
00:40:09,440 --> 00:40:11,480
Boss's business has been booming these past two years.

584
00:40:11,920 --> 00:40:13,280
Looks like the heavens are watching over him too.

585
00:40:14,199 --> 00:40:14,639
Yeah.

586
00:40:15,199 --> 00:40:15,599
Brother Rong.

587
00:40:15,800 --> 00:40:16,360
Sister-in-law.

588
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:23,320
What took you so long praying this time?

589
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:25,960
How many times have I told you?

590
00:40:26,000 --> 00:40:27,440
You must keep the gods in your heart.

591
00:40:28,239 --> 00:40:28,599
Right.

592
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:30,719
Keep them in your heart.

593
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:34,280
You're a good person.

594
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:35,880
As long as you have the gods in your heart,

595
00:40:36,039 --> 00:40:38,239
the heavens will protect all of us.

596
00:40:39,719 --> 00:40:41,480
Didn't you say you've been busy lately?

597
00:40:41,639 --> 00:40:42,960
How did you find the time to come here?

598
00:40:43,840 --> 00:40:45,920
I came solely to spend time with you.

599
00:40:45,960 --> 00:40:48,119
I left everything to the boys.

600
00:40:49,320 --> 00:40:50,360
This is Country M.

601
00:40:50,519 --> 00:40:51,559
Don't tell me

602
00:40:51,920 --> 00:40:53,760
you came all this way just to sightsee with me.

603
00:40:54,239 --> 00:40:55,760
I really did come just to travel with you.

604
00:40:56,800 --> 00:40:58,519
Of course, while I'm at it,

605
00:40:58,800 --> 00:41:01,199
I'll pay respects to a few senior business associates.

606
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:06,800
Didn't you tell me before

607
00:41:07,199 --> 00:41:08,920
that your business ran into some trouble?

608
00:41:09,199 --> 00:41:10,800
I thought you were planning to get out.

609
00:41:14,440 --> 00:41:16,280
So many boys rely on me to put food on the table.

610
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:17,679
Even if I wanted to quit,

611
00:41:18,199 --> 00:41:20,440
I'd have to find a way out for them first, right?

612
00:41:24,559 --> 00:41:25,960
To tell you the truth,

613
00:41:27,400 --> 00:41:29,719
our business in Nanhai hit a snag.

614
00:41:30,199 --> 00:41:32,000
All our smuggling routes are unusable.

615
00:41:32,199 --> 00:41:33,360
Li Qiang went back this time,

616
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:35,199
and if he can't fix it,

617
00:41:35,360 --> 00:41:37,000
there'll be even bigger trouble.

618
00:41:38,320 --> 00:41:40,280
So my coming to Country M

619
00:41:40,679 --> 00:41:43,519
is to find a chance to meet Mr. Theerade.

620
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:47,960
I don't understand your business,

621
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,400
but whatever you do,

622
00:41:51,719 --> 00:41:53,280
you must stay safe, understand?

623
00:41:54,360 --> 00:41:55,039
Don't worry.

624
00:41:55,440 --> 00:41:57,360
The heavens will watch over us.

625
00:42:22,039 --> 00:42:22,920
You don't have to walk me up.

626
00:42:23,039 --> 00:42:23,880
I can go up myself.

627
00:42:24,519 --> 00:42:25,599
Head back and get some rest early.

628
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:27,360
You're not upset, are you?

629
00:42:28,719 --> 00:42:29,599
Why would I be?

630
00:42:29,719 --> 00:42:30,440
I had a good time.

631
00:42:30,840 --> 00:42:32,079
Because you were with me.

632
00:42:39,679 --> 00:42:40,320
Go on.

633
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:42,960
Get home and rest early, okay?

634
00:42:43,079 --> 00:42:43,440
Okay.

635
00:42:48,880 --> 00:42:49,440
Bye.
